% composition-series: CBC Modern Canadian Bridges — pilot
% composition-grade: 6
% composition-elements: anacrusis; straight eighths against eighth-note triplets; syncopated rests; i-iv-V harmony in D minor; layered ostinato, spoken verse and sung hook; sixteen-bar verse/hook form
% composition-listen: Dream Warriors — "Wash Your Face in My Sink" (1990), from And Now the Legacy Begins, official video; its album words are clean, but the video runs 30 seconds longer than the album version, so watch it once first
